And l shaIl never see you again.

284
00:26:50.066 --> 00:26:52.985
[MAN SHOUTlNG]

285
00:27:34.611 --> 00:27:40.407
[CROWD CHEERING]

286
00:28:39.634 --> 00:28:43.137
[CLAPPlNG]

287
00:28:51.229 --> 00:28:53.647
PRlAM: My son.
-Father.

288
00:28:58.653 --> 00:29:00.946
Paris.

289
00:29:06.578 --> 00:29:07.911
Father.

290
00:29:09.247 --> 00:29:11.582
