Father...

306
00:30:37.377 --> 00:30:39.962
...l know this is the last thing we need.

307
00:30:40.129 --> 00:30:44.675
It is the will of the gods.
Everything is in their hands.

308
00:30:45.301 --> 00:30:49.680
-But I'm surprised you Iet him bring her.
-If I'd let him fight MeneIaus for her...

309
