They'lI never believe we've left.

351
00:33:13.866 --> 00:33:17.494
And even if they do.
they'lI burn it for spite.

352
00:33:20.832 --> 00:33:23.333
Then l'll make it easy for him to find me.

353
00:33:26.004 --> 00:33:28.672
I'Il waIk right up to him
and tell him you're mine.

354
00:33:34.012 --> 00:33:36.013
You're very young. my Iove.

355
00:34:40.995 --> 00:34:42.871
[CHANTlNG]

356
00:34:44.749 --> 00:34:46.249
HECTOR:
Look at that.

357
00:35:15.780 --> 00:35:20.367
[ASTYANAX CRYlNG]

358
00:35:24.163 --> 00:35:28.166
[CROWD SCREAMING]

359
