Flank! To the flank!

420
00:42:45.312 --> 00:42:46.980
[GRUNTS]

421
00:43:16.093 --> 00:43:21.097
<i>Achilles! Achilles! Achilles! Achilles!</i>
<i>Achilles!</i>

422
00:43:43.787 --> 00:43:47.707
[WARRIORS CHANTING]

423
00:43:53.047 --> 00:43:56.215
Back to the city! Back to the city!

424
00:44:03.724 --> 00:44:07.435
The sun god is a patron of Troy.
our enemy.

425
00:44:08.646 --> 00:44:10.396
Take whatever treasure you can find.

426
00:44:10.564 --> 00:44:13.483
[CHEERING]

427
00:44:15.486 --> 00:44:17.195
EUDORUS:
With your permission. my Iord.

428
00:44:22.117 --> 00:44:25.078
-Speak.
-ApoIlo sees everything.

429
